<title>USA: MEAG $191 mln bonds at 5.85 pct top yield in 2025.</title>
<headline>MEAG $191 mln bonds at 5.85 pct top yield in 2025.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
